    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-39247",
      "sequence_position": 19,
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14243854/assets/88be779d85ba51746abba7a71cad58b6986fd72a14ba4fc09e8b015494f57c0e.png)\n\nConsider the vector $v$ shown above. Find the vector $Av$ given that \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} & -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "Notice that $A$ is a rotation-scaling matrix. So, we need to find its scale factor and the angle of rotation.\n\nWe can find the scale factor using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =\\sqrt{det(A)} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4})}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can represent $A$ as a product of a rotation and a scaling matrix, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}r & 0 \\\\ 0 & r\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  & \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we obtain that\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\\,⟹\\,\\theta =-\\frac{3\\pi }{4}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, in order to find $Av$, we need to rotate $v$ clockwise by an angle of $\\frac{3\\pi }{4}$  and scale the result by a scale factor of $\\frac{1}{2},$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14243854/assets/f5f7e7fa8d149ae9b6f07af57cbc8fc103b2d7c306aec98dbb2119145aa276ca.png)",
